graph TB
    subgraph Daemon
        MCP[MCP Proxy]
        EVT[Event Router]
        SYNC[Sync Loop]
        WEB[Web Dashboard]
        PUSH[Branch Pusher]
    end

    CLI[CLI] -->|unix socket| MCP
    Browser[Browser] -->|TCP :26024| WEB
    AgentA[Agent A] -->|SSE| EVT
    AgentB[Agent B] -->|HTTP proxy| MCP
    Git[Git Remote] <-->|push/fetch| SYNC
    SYNC -->|CI failures| EVT
    SYNC -->|PR comments| EVT
    EVT -->|auto-unblock| AgentA
    PUSH -->|auto-push| Git
